## Why This Is Asked
Tests integration of high-assurance cryptography with a mobile bridge, plus secure storage, verification UX, and offline resilience.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end encryption with per-device long-term keys and per-session keys
- Rust-native module bridged to RN via JSI for performance and safety
- Forward secrecy via a ratcheting scheme (Double Ratchet-like)
- Secure storage using Keychain/Keystore with biometric unlock
- Out-of-band verification and key rotation flow
- Offline messaging with rekeying and queueing

